+ * rebuilds a global device list, and so does its translation of the
+ * device-added event on the pumping thread -- which frees the list before it
+ * takes the joystick lock. Two threads freed the same block ("malloc():
+ * unaligned tcache chunk detected"). One thread doing both cannot race. */
+void xbox_InputSdlDeviceEvent(const SDL_Event *ev)
